Z||000000||mrfiero||11-08-2000||10:24 PM||||I just bought the new issue of Car & Driver (Nov. '00) ancd there is a 2 page article about the new Opel Speedster and it's possible importation to the US.  They seem to squash the idea that it will be the "new" Fiero.  Here is an excerpt from the article:<P>"Now for the big question: Will the Speedster come to America, perhaps as a resurrected Fiero?  Let us answer that succinctly:  Is crack cocaine a healthy way to lose weight?"<P>More cheap shots at the Fieros expense! ||||reg||8
