Z||000004||2M4 Dale||11-09-2000||09:15 AM||||I have a free subscrition to Car and Driver and Road and Track magazines.....these are perhaps the worst, all time, auto magazines that I have ever read. <P>I , personally, hope that that junky OPEL doesn't make an entry into the states as a Fiero.....Just more bad press......seems like it is poorly constructed.<P>I just recieved the new Road and Track, yesterday. It is a special issue that focuses on Mid-engine production vehicles. They only managed to barely mention that Pontiac manufactured a production mid-engine...and the way that it was mentioned was deffinatly derogatory.<P>I really think that these magazines should be renamed      "More Money Than Brains"   and   "If I Were A Rich Man"<P><p>[This message has been edited by 2M4 Dale (edited 11-09-2000).]||||reg||8
