Z||000008||Fformula88||11-09-2000||04:20 PM||||C&D was not very kind to the Fiero in that article  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">, but it was still a lot nicer than the Automobile Mag editorial  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif">  I gotta give it to MotorTrend though.  There desire to see the car badged a Fiero is a real compliment to our Fiero's.  I guess we aren't ALL wrong  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif">  Someone likes our car!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.geocities.com/formula2m6/FIEROSIG1.JPG">  <BR>1988 Fiero Formula||||reg||1
